Original commit body from dfd8c19a522791382168055e6e190ebee23d4e82:

Ruling 6 (WI-himod): Edge.create(resolution_score=s) interpolates a name
resolver's grade inside the pathway band, low + (base - low) x s, via
confidence.derive_resolved_confidence. 87 producer sites that multiplied
a private base by the grade now pass the grade; 12 pathways whose only
producers multiplied are seeded at their exact-match base. Call edges in
glsl, hlsl, nix, wgsl, fortran and R that were labelled `static` (a
static-linkage declaration) are relabelled ast_call_direct; fortran's
`use` is ast_import. External targets set is_resolved=False and derive
the unresolved base. The JS/TS scope-bound / explicit-import 0.90 and
C's 0.95 x grade (the 42 INV-zatug self-tree violations) are now 0.85.

Ruling 7 (WI-nibar): spec_validator judges an edge whose origins are all
registered linkers (catalog.all_linker_pass_ids) by the spec section 12
linker range, 0.40-0.95, not by its declared pathway's analyzer band.

WI-midoj: the 12 out-of-band literals (build_target_main 1.0 x7, css,
go naming_convention 0.95, circom x2, solidity) derive or pass a grade.

WI-lapun: the 14 remaining analyzer branch-tier sites derive (imports,
includes and local-registry calls set is_resolved instead of a lower
literal; matlab/purescript/racket/scheme/robot no longer publish 1.0),
pass a grade (llvm_ir, agda, ruby route grades), or carry an
'# ADR-0039 caller-valued:' justification (ast_call_namespace and
qualified_call, pending-classification placeholders with no band).

WI-vosif: hypergumbo_core.confidence_sites + scripts/check-confidence-sites,
a shrink-only static gate over every Edge.create(confidence=...) site
(.ci/confidence-sites-baseline.json, empty). 0 findings on this tree,
123 on dev before this change. smart-test unions the gate test into any
change that touches package source, since the import-graph slice never
selects it.

